# DESIGN FLAW, found when the "controls" moved.  P3 and P16 were carried as DIRGATE controls on
# the premise that this change is non-DIRGATE-only.  That premise is wrong.  DIRGATE injects its
# settings with `if _k not in os.environ`, and OGC_RESFRAC is one of the three it injects, so an
# arm that SETS OGC_RESFRAC overrides the gate instead of leaving it alone.  Arms B and C
# therefore move P3/P16 from RESFRAC 0.50 (DIRGATE's value) to 0.20/0.10 -- they are treatment
# cells, not controls, and nothing here vetoes anything.
